# Safe local environment template
#
# Copy this file to ".env" only if this project or one of its optional
# integrations needs local environment variables:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Add only the variable names documented by the project and provide your own
# values/credentials. Never commit the populated .env file.
#
# Example shape only (not a real project credential):
# VARIABLE_NAME=replace-with-your-own-value
